# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the progression page (SEL + HOME twice) at Snap 100, stepped with
# F3 both ways: REST (a tap steps, held the chord rests) and HOLD (held the chord plays, let go it rests).
# Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
wait 300
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
turn ALGO 10
wait 2500
wav progression-rest.wav
tapkey F3
wait 2500
key F3 down
wait 1200
shot progression-rest.png
key F3 up
wait 2500
tapkey F3
wait 1500
key F3 down
wait 1500
key F3 up
wait 2000
shot progression-steps.png
tapkey F#3
wait 2500
wavstop
press SEL
key F3 down
key F3 up
release SEL
wait 500
wav progression-hold.wav
key F3 down
wait 1500
key F3 up
wait 1200
key F3 down
wait 1500
key F3 up
wait 1200
key F#3 down
wait 1500
key F#3 up
wait 1500
shot progression-hold.png
wavstop
